        {
          "id": 526704675,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "It is RFC 6386, not 6385. The relevant RFC is 7741 https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7741#section-4.3 and https://sites.google.com/a/alvestrand.com/rtc-web/home/papers/lundin-vp8-rtp.pdf\n\nWhy should we describe different versions? We do not describe show_bit itself.\n\nAnd yeah, my fix is right. Key frame **must** be shown.",
